        "original_id": "4c6bdc29-f667-56c1-8716-c3cf6988ada8",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Peter Bart, Kirk Kerkorian\n- Organizations: MGM, Tracinda Corporation\n- Places: Beverly Hills, California\n- Products: Fade Out: The Calamitous Final Days of MGM\n- Topics: MGM history, corporate ownership\n\nFacts:\n- In 1969, Kirk Kerkorian bought MGM.\n- Fade Out: The Calamitous Final Days of MGM is a 1990 non-fiction book by Peter Bart.\n- Fade Out: The Calamitous Final Days of MGM covers the history of MGM since Kirk Kerkorian bought MGM in 1969.\n- Kirk Kerkorian was the president and CEO of Tracinda Corporation.\n- Tracinda Corporation was Kirk Kerkorian's private holding company based in Beverly Hills, California.",
